# === SCANNED JD POSTINGS (real company data + PII -- JobRight/LinkedIn
# results can include social_connections with real people's names and
# LinkedIn URLs) -- only the code that produces/consumes these is tracked,
# never the postings themselves. dummy_jd.txt is the one deliberate,
# already-tracked exception (a real fixture, and a .txt not .json). ===
jds/*.json
jds/completed/*.json


